From 0bd7ed22760f41322c865191057fedae305ef147 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: AF9 <af9@localhost>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:14:18 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fusion reactors: parts on any casing block of the ring; one
 input and one output fluid hatch, one laser hatch, two primary energy hatches
 (7.5.3-af9.26)

The ring's casing blocks all take hatches. Fluid input (1, required) and output (1), laser (1) are limited by the structure; energy hatches are not, but only two may be primary power: any further one has to be Auxiliary, else the reactor builds no field and runs nothing. No maintenance hatch.
